# Implementation Plan - Profile Redesign "Sanctuary Identity"

## Goal
Transform the Profile functionality into a "Soulful, Artistic, and Premium" experience by implementing the "Sanctuary Identity" design. This involves separating user identity from app settings and introducing new interactive components.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> This redesign completely replaces the current "Tab Switcher" UI in the Profile screen with a vertical "Identity Card + Control Scroll" layout.

## Proposed Changes

### Components [NEW]
#### [NEW] [IdentityCard.tsx](file:///C:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/profile/IdentityCard.tsx)
-   **Purpose**: Displays user identity (Name, Role, School) in a "Glassmorphism" card.
-   **Features**:
    -   Flip animation (Front: Details, Back: QR Code placeholder).
    -   Progress Ring around Avatar (GOLDEN).
    -   "Verified" badge logic.
    -   Tap to trigger `EditProfileModal`.

#### [NEW] [ControlScroll.tsx](file:///C:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/profile/ControlScroll.tsx)
-   **Purpose**: Vertical scrollable list for App Settings.
-   **Features**:
    -   Items: Language, Theme, Data Saver.
    -   Style: "LotusPetal" rows (soft rounded, touch feedback).
    -   Language Switcher integration (reusing logic from current ProfileScreen).

#### [NEW] [EditProfileModal.tsx](file:///C:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/profile/EditProfileModal.tsx)
-   **Purpose**: Full-screen modal for editing profile details.
-   **Features**:
    -   Form fields: Full Name, Role, School Name.
    -   Save functionality (Supabase update).

### Screens [MODIFY]
#### [MODIFY] [ProfileScreen.tsx](file:///C:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/screens/ProfileScreen.tsx)
-   **Changes**:
    -   Remove `VStack`, `HStack`, [Button](file:///C:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/LotusButton.tsx#80-143) based "Tab Switcher" UI.
    -   Import and render `IdentityCard` at the top.
    -   Import and render `ControlScroll` below.
    -   Manage state for `EditProfileModal` visibility.
    -   Pass `loading`, `profile`, `refreshProfile` props to children.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
-   Verify TSX compilation using `npx tsc --noEmit`.

### Manual Verification
-   **Identity Card**:
    -   Check if user details load correctly.
    -   Test "Flip" interaction (tap card).
    -   Test "Edit" interaction (tap Edit button or details).
-   **Control Scroll**:
    -   Test Language switching (Sinhala/Tamil/English).
    -   Check visual feedback on touch.
-   **Edit Modal**:
    -   Open modal, change name, save.
    -   Verify profile updates on main screen.
-   **Responsiveness**:
    -   Ensure scroll works on smaller screens.
